:: asciijump, version 0.0.1 Wed Feb 12 03:52:21 CET 2003
:: 


asciijump is a small and funny ASCII-art game about ski jumping.


r e q u i r e s :
slang-devel


i n s t a ll :

Following sequence of shell commands should build, check and install 
this game:
	autoconf
	./configure
	make all
	su
	make install
	
Installation prefix defaults to /usr/local, see ./configure --help for
info how to override it.


l i c e n s e   : 
gnu gpl v 2.




a s c i i j u m p   s e r v e r 
s i m p l e   u s a g e   : 

"invite" - this allow users to join in.
"hill read random" - this add some random hills.
when some users are connected, (check it by "user show *" )
type : "play" - to strat playing.

type "help", or "'command' help" to get more info




